{"created_at": "2018-11-06T22:46:35.000Z", "description": ""It was an old cold world. 

Our beloved sun, covered up. 

Dark clouds passed through my eyes. 

Memories of light flashed in my retina: a red-blue-purple sunset of yesterday. 

But I have to admit it, it might be the last time. "

//

The story was written in an open google docs where each user contributed with a small part. The following contributors registered their twitter handles: @artonymousart,
@hex0x6c,
@danieljakobian,
@Cryp_to_Art,
@oficinastk & 
@aigenerated_com


//

The short story was then run through https://t2i.cvalenzuelab.com/ which is based on https://github.com/taoxugit/AttnGAN/

The picture that is tokenized is the result of a rework in Photoshop of several of the frames the short story produced, combined and edited.", "image_original_uri": "https://storage.googleapis.com/sr_prod_artworks_bucket/asset%2Faa5aeb82fd23b29062badf8ded30dba224a06efd0eb614a853bc945c32249b0b.gif", "image_url": "https://pixura.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fstorage.googleapis.com%2Fsr_prod_artworks_bucket%2Fasset%252Faa5aeb82fd23b29062badf8ded30dba224a06efd0eb614a853bc945c32249b0b.gif?ixlib=js-3.8.0&width=550&height=550&fm=avif&fit=crop&video=false&name=ImageMedium&auto=compress&s=349643965ae76dff03209500564dc930", "source_url": "https://superrare.com/0x41a322b28d0ff354040e2cbc676f0320d8c8850d/912", "superrare_contract": "0x41a322b28d0ff354040e2cbc676f0320d8c8850d", "superrare_token_id": "912", "superrare_universal_token_id": "1-0x41a322b28d0ff354040e2cbc676f0320d8c8850d-912", "tags": ["shortstory"]}

